# Studio probe: notes sound at their pitch. A4 (440 Hz) on a sampled
# violin section (its zones, keycenters and measured tune), then on a plain
# sine synth. Dry, centred, no reverb. 120 BPM: a beat is 0.5 s.
score 1
tempo 0 120
length 8
tail 0.5
inst violin sfz=../samples/violins_sus.sfz attack=0.05 release=0.2
inst sine synth wave=sine attack=0.01 decay=0 sustain=1 release=0.05
note 0 3.5 violin A4 100
note 4 3.5 sine A4 100
